---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="CE Marking & Technical Conformity Certification | Eurocert Asia"
  description="Comprehensive CE certification services ensuring your products meet all EU directives and standards for seamless market access across Europe."
>
<section class="relative min-h-[70vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367850/eurocert/technical-conformity-ce-certification-make-an-imag.jpeg.jpg" class="w-full h-full object-cover" alt="Technical conformity and CE certification hero banner for EU market compliance"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]/85"></div></div><div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none"><div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-eurogold-400/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] animate-pulse"></div><div class="absolute bottom-1/4 right-1/4 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-euro-500/10 rounded-full blur-[80px] animate-pulse" style="animation-delay:2s"></div><div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-full h-full opacity-[0.02]" style="background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, white 1px, transparent 0);background-size:50px 50px"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-32"><div data-reveal="reveal-up" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-5 py-2.5 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-eurogold-400/30 rounded-full mb-10"><div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center bg-eurogold-400/20 rounded-lg text-eurogold-400"><svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg></div><span class="text-eurogold-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em]">European Compliance</span></div><h1 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="100" class="heading-font text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-bold text-white mb-5 tracking-tight drop-shadow-lg">Technical <span className="inline-block" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, #e5be65 0%, #9cb1c9 50%, #708dcd 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; color: transparent; font-weight: 800;">Conformity</span></h1><h2 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="200" class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6 tracking-tight drop-shadow-md">CE Certification</h2><div data-reveal="reveal-scale" data-reveal-delay="300" class="w-40 h-1 mx-auto mb-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-eurogold-400 via-eurogold-300 to-euro-400"></div><p data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="400" class="text-white/80 text-base md:text-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed drop-shadow-sm">Comprehensive CE certification services ensuring your products meet all EU directives and standards for seamless market access across Europe</p><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="500" class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mt-10"><a class="px-8 py-4 text-white font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-0.5" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg, #D4A843 0%, #0a2463 100%)" href="/contact/#contact-form">Get Certified</a><a href="tel:+919316012883" class="px-8 py-4 border border-white/40 text-white font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-xl hover:bg-white/20 transition-all duration-300">Call Now</a></div></div></section>

<section class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center"><div data-reveal="reveal-left" class="space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-4">Technical Conformity</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">CE Certification</h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-lg leading-relaxed">CE marking is the mandatory conformity marking for products sold within the European Economic Area (EEA). It demonstrates that your products meet EU safety, health, and environmental protection requirements.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-base leading-relaxed">At <strong class="text-slate-900">Eurocert Asia</strong>, our expert team guides you through the entire certification process, ensuring full compliance with all relevant EU directives and standards.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-eurogold-300/40 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-eurogold-400/10 transition-all duration-300 group"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 text-eurogold-500 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-flask"></i></span><div><h5 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Expert Guidance</h5><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Industry-certified professionals</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-eurogold-300/40 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-eurogold-400/10 transition-all duration-300 group"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 text-eurogold-500 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-scale-balanced"></i></span><div><h5 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Directive Compliance</h5><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Full EU standards adherence</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-eurogold-300/40 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-eurogold-400/10 transition-all duration-300 group"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 text-eurogold-500 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i></span><div><h5 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Fast-track Audit</h5><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Quick certification process</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-eurogold-300/40 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-eurogold-400/10 transition-all duration-300 group"><span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 text-eurogold-500 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-earth-americas"></i></span><div><h5 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Global Market Support</h5><p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Worldwide recognition</p></div></div></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-right" data-reveal-delay="200" class="relative"><div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-eurogold-400/10 border border-slate-100 h-[450px] lg:h-[550px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367707/eurocert/Gemini_Generated_Image_doy2sldoy2sldoy2.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="CE certified product compliance visual for European directives"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/50 via-transparent to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-8 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/90 to-transparent"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div><h4 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-1">Certified Excellence</h4><p class="text-white/60 text-sm">1000+ certifications delivered</p></div><div class="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center bg-eurogold-400/20 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/30"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute -top-6 -right-6 w-24 h-24 bg-euro-600 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl flex items-center justify-center animate-pulse"><span class="text-white text-3xl font-bold">CE</span></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16] via-[#0a1628] to-[#030a16]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h4 data-reveal="reveal-up" class="heading-font text-xs text-eurogold-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-4">Comprehensive Services</h4><h2 data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="100" class="heading-font text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Our Certifications</h2><p data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="200" class="text-white/70 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Choose from our wide range of CE certification services tailored to your industry needs</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-6"><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="0" class="group p-6 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-eurogold-400/40 transition-all duration-300"><div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 h-40"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367580/eurocert/CONSTRUCTION.jpeg.jpg" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="CE Certification for Construction Products"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent"></div></div><h3 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-2 line-clamp-2">CE Certification for Construction Products</h3><p class="text-white/70 text-sm line-clamp-3 mb-4">Construction products must comply with the Construction Products Regulation (CPR) to be placed on the EU market. We help manufacturers achieve CE marking for construction materials, ensuring they meet all safety and performance requirements.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4"><span class="text-eurogold-400 text-xs">Construction Products (CPR)</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#f1ebdf] px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#cb6a00] transition hover:bg-[#e6dcc6]"><i class="fas fa-circle-info text-[10px]"></i>Know More</button><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-[#e0be63] px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#cb6a00] transition hover:bg-[#fff7e8]" href="/construction-products"><i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i>Details</a></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="50" class="group p-6 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-eurogold-400/40 transition-all duration-300"><div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 h-40"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367739/eurocert/LIFTS.jpeg.jpg" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="CE Certification for Lifts"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent"></div></div><h3 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-2 line-clamp-2">CE Certification for Lifts</h3><p class="text-white/70 text-sm line-clamp-3 mb-4">Lifts and lifting equipment must comply with the Lifts Directive (2014/33/EU) to be sold in the EU. We provide comprehensive certification services for all types of lifts and lifting equipment.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4"><span class="text-eurogold-400 text-xs">Lifts Directive (2014/33/EU)</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#f1ebdf] px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#cb6a00] transition hover:bg-[#e6dcc6]"><i class="fas fa-circle-info text-[10px]"></i>Know More</button><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-[#e0be63] px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#cb6a00] transition hover:bg-[#fff7e8]" href="/lifts"><i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i>Details</a></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="100" class="group p-6 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-eurogold-400/40 transition-all duration-300"><div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 h-40"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367745/eurocert/MACHINERY.jpeg.jpg" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="CE Marking for Machinery"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent"></div></div><h3 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-2 line-clamp-2">CE Marking for Machinery</h3><p class="text-white/70 text-sm line-clamp-3 mb-4">The Machinery Directive (2006/42/EC) requires that machinery placed on the EU market must be CE marked. We assist manufacturers in achieving compliance for all types of machinery and equipment.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4"><span class="text-eurogold-400 text-xs">Machinery Directive (2006/42/EC)</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#f1ebdf] px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#cb6a00] transition hover:bg-[#e6dcc6]"><i class="fas fa-circle-info text-[10px]"></i>Know More</button><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-[#e0be63] px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#cb6a00] transition hover:bg-[#fff7e8]" href="/machinery"><i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i>Details</a></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="150" class="group p-6 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-eurogold-400/40 transition-all duration-300"><div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 h-40"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367829/eurocert/R1.jpeg.jpg" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="CE Marking for Cement"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent"></div></div><h3 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-2 line-clamp-2">CE Marking for Cement</h3><p class="text-white/70 text-sm line-clamp-3 mb-4">Cement products must comply with harmonized European standards to receive CE marking. We provide certification services for various types of cement products.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4"><span class="text-eurogold-400 text-xs">Cement Products</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#f1ebdf] px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#cb6a00] transition hover:bg-[#e6dcc6]"><i class="fas fa-circle-info text-[10px]"></i>Know More</button><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-[#e0be63] px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#cb6a00] transition hover:bg-[#fff7e8]" href="/cement"><i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i>Details</a></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="200" class="group p-6 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-eurogold-400/40 transition-all duration-300"><div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 h-40"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367819/eurocert/PED.jpeg.jpg" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="PED Certification (2014/68/EU)"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent"></div></div><h3 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-2 line-clamp-2">PED Certification (2014/68/EU)</h3><p class="text-white/70 text-sm line-clamp-3 mb-4">The Pressure Equipment Directive (PED) applies to pressure equipment and assemblies with a maximum allowable pressure greater than 0.5 bar. We provide comprehensive PED certification services.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4"><span class="text-eurogold-400 text-xs">Pressure Equipment Directive</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#f1ebdf] px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#cb6a00] transition hover:bg-[#e6dcc6]"><i class="fas fa-circle-info text-[10px]"></i>Know More</button><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-[#e0be63] px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#cb6a00] transition hover:bg-[#fff7e8]" href="/ped"><i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i>Details</a></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="250" class="group p-6 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-eurogold-400/40 transition-all duration-300"><div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 h-40"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367856/eurocert/ROHS.jpeg.jpg" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="RoHS Certification"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent"></div></div><h3 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-2 line-clamp-2">RoHS Certification</h3><p class="text-white/70 text-sm line-clamp-3 mb-4">The RoHS Directive restricts the use of certain hazardous substances in electrical and electronic equipment. We help manufacturers ensure compliance with RoHS requirements.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4"><span class="text-eurogold-400 text-xs">Restriction of Hazardous Substances</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#f1ebdf] px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#cb6a00] transition hover:bg-[#e6dcc6]"><i class="fas fa-circle-info text-[10px]"></i>Know More</button><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-[#e0be63] px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#cb6a00] transition hover:bg-[#fff7e8]" href="/rohs"><i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i>Details</a></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-up" data-reveal-delay="300" class="group p-6 bg-white/5 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-eurogold-400/40 transition-all duration-300"><div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 h-40"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367742/eurocert/LVDEMC.jpeg.jpg" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="CE Marking LVD/EMC"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent"></div></div><h3 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-2 line-clamp-2">CE Marking LVD/EMC</h3><p class="text-white/70 text-sm line-clamp-3 mb-4">The Low Voltage Directive (LVD) and Electromagnetic Compatibility (EMC) Directive are essential for electrical and electronic equipment sold in the EU. We provide comprehensive CE marking services for LVD and EMC compliance.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4"><span class="text-eurogold-400 text-xs">Low Voltage &amp; EMC Directive</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#f1ebdf] px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#cb6a00] transition hover:bg-[#e6dcc6]"><i class="fas fa-circle-info text-[10px]"></i>Know More</button><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-[#e0be63] px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase